  "goodToKnow": "Das Fachwissen is expertise or specialist knowledge: fundiertes Fachwissen, Fachwissen vermitteln. Job ads ask for Fachkenntnisse (specialist skills), and Germany's Fachkräftemangel (shortage of skilled workers) is a major economic issue. Das Wissen is knowledge: Wissen ist Macht. The anglicism das Know-how is also common. It has no plural."
